    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em><strong>Sickening Vapors.</strong></em> <em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=a9NAwfq8B1qvfEi7]], each creature in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=a9NAwfq8B1qvfEi7]]-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]] at the end of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s turn. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn. <em>Success:</em> The target is immune to this [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s Sickening Vapors for 24 hours.</p>",
